    {
      "id": "tang-942",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "酬金部王郎中省中春日见寄",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "卢纶",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "南宫树色晓森森，虽有春光未有阴。\n鹤侣正疑芳景引，玉人那为簿书沈。\n山含瑞气偏当日，莺逐轻风不在林。\n更有阮郎迷路处，万株红树一溪深。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "d3e6a4874f4d10a51ef4d6d21b8b11c3729967eff53afe60e94d89299e509710",
      "estimatedOutput": 734,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-942--d3e6a4874f4d10a51ef4d6d21b8b11c3729967eff53afe60e94d89299e509710.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-943",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "病客吟",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "孟郊",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "主人夜呻吟，皆入妻子心。\n客子昼呻吟，徒为虫鸟音。\n妻子手中病，愁思不复深。\n僮仆手中病，忧危独难任。\n丈夫久漂泊，神气自然沉。\n况于滞疾中，何人免嘘eS.大海亦有涯，高山亦有岑。\n沉忧独无极，尘泪互盈襟。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "f381c32cc102e6c97b35441ffbf8bc8f30a07644642b469b84c26c241d2d4d32",
      "estimatedOutput": 806,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-943--f381c32cc102e6c97b35441ffbf8bc8f30a07644642b469b84c26c241d2d4d32.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-944",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "扬州三首",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "杜牧",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "炀帝雷塘土，迷藏有旧楼。\n谁家唱水调，明月满扬州。\n骏马宜闲出，千金好旧游。\n喧阗醉年少，半脱紫茸裘。\n秋风放萤苑，春草斗鸡台。\n金络擎雕去，鸾环拾翠来。\n蜀船红锦重，越橐水沈堆。\n处处皆华表，淮王奈却回。\n街垂千步柳，霞映两重城。\n天碧台阁丽，风凉歌管清。\n纤腰间长袖，玉珮杂繁缨。\n拖轴诚为壮，豪华不可名。\n自是荒淫罪，何妨作帝京。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "c166a4c644d4d853f3dea25166d2dc68f81d2f16ac0c7c74947ecafed1bbc7c0",
      "estimatedOutput": 936,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-944--c166a4c644d4d853f3dea25166d2dc68f81d2f16ac0c7c74947ecafed1bbc7c0.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-945",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "官舍",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "白居易",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "高树换新叶，阴阴覆地隅。\n何言太守宅，有似幽人居。\n太守卧其下，闲慵两有馀。\n起尝一瓯茗，行读一卷书。\n早梅结青实，残樱落红珠。\n稚女弄庭果，嬉戏牵人裾。\n是日晚弥静，巢禽下相呼。\n啧啧护儿鹊，哑哑母子乌。\n岂唯云鸟尔，吾亦引吾雏。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "e17bf6f3f8a3a7d829ab71a0eaa4f5fbb0e5b26c4910c5def20414c617eb5081",
      "estimatedOutput": 832,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-945--e17bf6f3f8a3a7d829ab71a0eaa4f5fbb0e5b26c4910c5def20414c617eb5081.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-946",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "金陵其二",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "李白",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "地拥金陵势。\n城回江水流。\n当时百万户。\n夹道起朱楼。\n亡国生春草。\n离宫没古丘。\n空余後湖月。\n波上对江洲。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "04e31063b5d6bdcb34a5cc5aeabd2dcc7c49e848422f75ba4537490384519dd5",
      "estimatedOutput": 710,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-946--04e31063b5d6bdcb34a5cc5aeabd2dcc7c49e848422f75ba4537490384519dd5.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-947",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "送李青归南叶",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "李白",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "伯阳仙家子，容色如青春。\n日月秘灵洞，云霞辞世人。\n化心养精魄，隐几窅天真。\n莫作千年别，归来城郭新。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "4f76e9ac768ea3e17b0e354651b174f39344cf3f5e912ad89e30df5bd2f45445",
      "estimatedOutput": 702,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-947--4f76e9ac768ea3e17b0e354651b174f39344cf3f5e912ad89e30df5bd2f45445.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-948",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "塞上",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "曹松",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "边寒来所阔，今日复明朝。\n河凌坚通马，胡云缺见雕。\n砂中程独泣，乡外隐谁招。\n回首若经岁，灵州生柳条。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "3369806b28be2404d707e48d5e28d8e664e18664f2cd43be25b45a696a781ea8",
      "estimatedOutput": 702,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-948--3369806b28be2404d707e48d5e28d8e664e18664f2cd43be25b45a696a781ea8.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-949",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "留别江陵王少府",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "张籍",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "迢迢山上路，病客独行迟。\n况此分手处，当君失意时。\n寒林远路驿，晚烧过荒陂。\n别后空回首，相逢未有期。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "019acfa146042ce84d8c53a5e3f595e7e6d157e85d9d7f5c873cc673d1c07b26",
      "estimatedOutput": 702,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-949--019acfa146042ce84d8c53a5e3f595e7e6d157e85d9d7f5c873cc673d1c07b26.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-950",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "少游荆湘因有是题",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "沈佺期",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "岘北焚蛟浦，巴东射雉田。\n岁时宜楚俗，耆旧在襄川。\n忆昨经过处，离今二十年。\n因君访生死，相识几人全。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "aad5371c064340776538abb0b56f37f3b8fa0fd114c71f8da405d65cdf56a929",
      "estimatedOutput": 702,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-950--aad5371c064340776538abb0b56f37f3b8fa0fd114c71f8da405d65cdf56a929.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-951",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "古寺老松",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "齐己",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "百岁禅师说，先师指此松。\n小年行道绕，早见偃枝重。\n月槛移孤影，秋亭卓一峰。\n终当因夜电，拏攫从云龙。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "6d9e8b0c4a4d42d0026a6af83097efcd14a04d6fd0f5074752b05060f10fc801",
